,"answer":"Submitting is free with a badge."},{"question":"Does a Launch Scroll listing provide a dofollow link?","answer":"Yes, a dofollow link on a domain rated 44."},{"question":"Do I need to link back to Launch Scroll?","answer":"Yes — a badge is required."},{"question":"What gets a listing rejected?","answer":"A site that cannot carry the badge or that the crawler cannot reach."}]', rw_summary='Launch Scroll is a free dofollow launch-tracking directory with a live badge gate and no other backlink. Domain rating is 44.', rw_fact_points='["No published review time","Free listing with a dofollow link","A live badge gates the form","Accepts SaaS, AI tools and dev tools"]', rw_submission_checks='["Install the badge before the form appears.","Make it dofollow to the reserved URL.","Reach overlaps with sister directories."]', rw_seo_title='Launch Scroll: Free Badge Listing, DR 44', rw_seo_description='How to submit to Launch Scroll: free dofollow launch listing gated on a live badge. Rules from the 2026-11-16 snapshot.' WHERE slug='launchscroll';
