List?","answer":"Submitting is free with a badge."},{"question":"Does an Ash List listing provide a dofollow link?","answer":"Yes, a dofollow link on a domain rated 41."},{"question":"Do I need to link back to Ash List?","answer":"Yes — a badge is required."},{"question":"What gets a listing rejected?","answer":"A site that cannot carry the badge or that the crawler cannot reach."}]', rw_summary='Ash List is a free dofollow software catalogue with a live badge gate and no other backlink. Domain rating is 41.', rw_fact_points='["No published review time","Free listing with a dofollow link","A live badge gates the form","Accepts SaaS, AI tools and dev tools"]', rw_submission_checks='["Install the badge before the form appears.","Make it dofollow to the reserved URL.","Reach overlaps with sister directories."]', rw_seo_title='Ash List: Free Badge Listing, DR 41', rw_seo_description='How to submit to Ash List: free dofollow software listing gated on a live badge. Rules from the 2026-11-16 snapshot.' WHERE slug='ashlist';
UPDATE submission_sites SET rw_source_lead='Five fields, no badge, no fee, and a followed link at the end of it.', rw_what_you_get='A dofollow listing from a five-field form, with no badge and no required backlink.', rw_you_need='["An account via Google","A URL, a title, tags and a description","At least one of their 102 categories"]', rw_eligibility='You need an account and a plausible AI angle — every shelf here is an AI category.', rw_submit_steps='["1 Sign in. Add Tool opens a Clerk dialog with Continue with Google on top.","2 Fill five fields: one or more categories from a searchable list of 102, a URL, a title, comma-separated tags and a description.","3 Submit. You land on the sponsor page, where your tool is listed as Awaiting Approval."]', rw_submit_requirements='["An account and one or more of 102 categories","A URL, a title, comma-separated tags and a short description"]', rw_rejection_reasons='["Anything with no plausible AI angle — every category here is AI"]', rw_gotchas='["There is no logo, screenshot or pricing field — whatever appears beside your listing they fetch themselves, so the page is out of your hands after the description.","Submitting drops you on a $250-a-month sponsorship page rather than a confirmation; the receipt is the Awaiting Approval row further down.","No review time is published, and that row is the only status you ever see."]', rw_faq='[{"question":"How long does BestofAI approval take?","answer":"No review time is published."},{"question":"How much does it cost to submit to BestofAI?","answer":"Listing is free; sponsorship $250 a month is offered after submit and never required."},{"question":"Does a BestofAI listing provide a dofollow link?","answer":"Yes, a dofollow link on a domain rated 42."},{"question":"Do I need to link back to BestofAI?","answer":"No backlink is required."},{"question":"What gets a listing rejected?","answer":"Anything with no plausible AI angle."}]', rw_summary='BestofAI is a free dofollow AI directory with a five-field form, no badge and no backlink. Domain rating is 42.', rw_fact_points='["No published review time","Free listing with a dofollow link","No badge or return link is expected","Accepts AI tools across 102 categories"]', rw_submission_checks='["No media fields — they scrape the rest.","The Awaiting Approval row is your receipt.","$250 sponsorship is optional."]', rw_seo_title='BestofAI: Free Dofollow Listing, DR 42', rw_seo_description='How to submit to BestofAI: free five-field dofollow AI listing, no badge or backlink. Rules from the 2026-11-16 snapshot.' WHERE slug='bestofai';
UPDATE submission_sites SET rw_source_lead='Four tiers from nothing to twenty-two dollars, and the badge is what turns the free one dofollow.', rw_what_you_get='A nofollow listing on free that becomes dofollow with their badge and a domain rating above 5.', rw_you_need='["An account via Google","A URL, a title, a summary and a Markdown description","A developer tool they say they curate"]', rw_eligibility='You need a tool a developer would use. Duplicates are refused outright, and anything below their quality bar is removed rather than left pending.', rw_submit_steps='["1 Pick a tier. The submit link goes to pricing; Free is the fourth card below three paid ones, and Choose Free opens the form.","2 Sign in with Google — the form is behind it.","3 Fill and send: a product URL, title, summary and a description accepting Markdown, then Submit Product. The form clears itself on success.","4 Check the profile. The submission appears under My Submissions marked Pending and Free — that row is the receipt."]', rw_submit_requirements='["An account and a product URL and title","A summary and a Markdown description","Their badge optional, and what makes a free listing followed"]', rw_rejection_reasons='["Duplicate submissions, and anything judged below their quality bar — removed rather than left pending"]', rw_gotchas='["The free link is nofollow unless you carry their badge, and the badge only counts if your domain rating is over 5, so a brand-new site gets nothing either way.","Pricing says free review takes one to two months while the form guidelines say one to two weeks — neither is a commitment and they disagree.","A rejected product is removed from the system rather than left pending, with no reason given.","The submit link goes to pricing with Free the fourth card down, so the free lane looks absent until you scroll."]', rw_faq='[{"question":"How long does CurateClick approval take?","answer":"One to two weeks by the form guidelines; pricing says one to two months."},{"question":"How much does it cost to submit to CurateClick?","answer":"Free with a nofollow link; badge makes it dofollow if DR is above 5. Fast Pass $19.90, Featured $29.90, Sponsored $39.90 are instant and dofollow."},{"question":"Does a CurateClick listing provide a dofollow link?","answer":"No on free without a qualifying badge — links are otherwise nofollow on a domain rated 42."},{"question":"Do I need to link back to CurateClick?","answer":"Only to make a free listing dofollow, and only with DR above 5."},{"question":"What gets a listing rejected?","answer":"Duplicates and anything below their quality bar."}]', rw_summary='CurateClick is a free nofollow developer-tool directory where a badge plus DR above 5 makes the link dofollow. Domain rating is 42.', rw_fact_points='["Free review of one to two months","Free link nofollow unless badge-qualified","Badge optional, not required to submit","Accepts developer tools"]', rw_submission_checks='["The badge needs DR above 5 to count.","Pricing and form disagree on timing.","Rejected listings vanish with no reason."]', rw_seo_title='CurateClick: Free Badge Listing, DR 42', rw_seo_description='How to submit to CurateClick: free nofollow dev-tool listing, dofollow with a qualifying badge. Rules from the 2026-11-16 snapshot.' WHERE slug='curateclick';
UPDATE submission_sites SET rw_source_lead='Submissions are priced in credits here, and one listing costs a hundred of them.', rw_what_you_get='A dofollow listing generated from your URL by AI, paid for with 100 credits.', rw_you_need='["Credits — a submission costs 100 of them","A URL — the only field the form asks for"]', rw_eligibility='You need credits. The submit button does nothing without them on the account.', rw_submit_steps='["1 Paste the URL. The form is one field; they say the AI handles everything else.","2 Pay. A submission costs 100 credits, bought as a $10 pack or on a monthly plan.","3 They generate the listing and its translations, quoted at about five minutes."]', rw_submit_requirements='["A website URL — the only field on the form","100 credits per submission, $10 for 100","An account, before the button does anything"]', rw_rejection_reasons='["Unwillingness to pay — the submit button does nothing without credits"]', rw_gotchas='["The form is one field with no price beside it, so it looks free until the button silently does nothing.","They generate the listing text and ten-plus translations themselves, so the words published under your product are theirs."]', rw_faq='[{"question":"How long does Dir2AI approval take?","answer":"No review time is published; generation is quoted at about five minutes."},{"question":"How much does it cost to submit to Dir2AI?","answer":"100 credits per submission, $10 for 100. Subscriptions $25/$45/$85 a month for 5/10/20 submissions with API access. No free submission."},{"question":"Does a Dir2AI listing provide a dofollow link?","answer":"Yes, a dofollow link on a domain rated 42."},{"question":"Do I need to link back to Dir2AI?","answer":"No backlink is required."},{"question":"What gets a listing rejected?","answer":"Having no credits — the button does nothing."}]', rw_summary='Dir2AI is a paid-only credit-based dofollow directory with no backlink, where one listing costs 100 credits ($10). Domain rating is 42.', rw_fact_points='["About five minutes to generate","Paid-only in credits, dofollow","No badge or return link is expected","Accepts SaaS, AI tools and indie products"]', rw_submission_checks='["The form hides the price — credits are spent at submit.","They write all the listing copy.","No account, no submission."]', rw_seo_title='Dir2AI: 100-Credit Dofollow Listing, DR 42', rw_seo_description='How to submit to Dir2AI: 100 credits ($10) for a dofollow listing, no backlink. AI writes the copy — 2026-11-16 snapshot.' WHERE slug='dir2ai';
UPDATE submission_sites SET rw_source_lead='A free listing that stays invisible until their badge is in your server-rendered HTML.', rw_what_you_get='A dofollow listing created instantly but kept off the directory until a server-rendered badge verifies.', rw_you_need='["A Google account — the only sign-in","A hosted square logo URL, a description up to 1,500 and one category","Their badge in your server-rendered HTML, not client-side injected"]', rw_eligibility='You need an account, a logo URL and a site that can render the badge server-side. Nothing is stated as a content bar.', rw_submit_steps='["1 Sign in before typing anything. Only Google is offered; the form claims to restore drafts across sign-in but did not.","2 Fill the details: a URL, a name, a tagline, a logo URL rather than an upload, a description up to 1,500, one category and tags.","3 Pick the free card — $0 with the badge; Premium $19 skips it entirely.","4 Take the badge snippet from step 2 and place it in server-rendered HTML.","5 Submit, then press Verify & go live from the dashboard. The listing is created as PENDING with Badge embed required until then."]', rw_submit_requirements='["Google sign-in and a product name, URL and tagline","A logo URL and a description up to 1,500 characters","One category and optional tags","Their badge in your server-rendered HTML"]', rw_rejection_reasons='["Nothing stated"]', rw_gotchas='["The listing is created but never appears until the badge verifies — without one you get a dashboard row and nothing public.","They require the badge in server-rendered HTML; a snippet mounted by client-side JavaScript will not pass, which catches React footers on client-rendered sites.","The form promises draft restore across sign-in but came back empty — fill it after signing in."]', rw_faq='[{"question":"How long does ListMySaaS approval take?","answer":"Instant — publication follows badge verification."},{"question":"How much does it cost to submit to ListMySaaS?","answer":"Free with a badge. Premium $19, down from $39, publishes instantly with no badge and adds a featured mark."},{"question":"Does a ListMySaaS listing provide a dofollow link?","answer":"Yes, a dofollow link on a domain rated 41."},{"question":"Do I need to link back to ListMySaaS?","answer":"Yes — a server-rendered badge is required on free."},{"question":"What gets a listing rejected?","answer":"Nothing stated."}]', rw_summary='ListMySaaS is a free dofollow SaaS directory that keeps listings invisible until a server-rendered badge verifies. Domain rating is 41.', rw_fact_points='["Instant creation, badge-gated publication","Free listing with a dofollow link","A server-rendered badge is required on free","Accepts SaaS, AI tools and dev tools"]', rw_submission_checks='["The badge must be server-rendered.","Sign in before filling — drafts are lost.","Premium $19 skips the badge."]', rw_seo_title='ListMySaaS: Free Badge Listing, DR 41', rw_seo_description='How to submit to ListMySaaS: free dofollow listing gated on a server-rendered badge. Draft caveat from the 2026-11-16 snapshot.' WHERE slug='listmysaas';
UPDATE submission_sites SET rw_source_lead='No account, no badge, dofollow when approved — and a 15MB ceiling on the one required image.', rw_what_you_get='A dofollow listing with no account or badge, where a private emailed edit link is your only way back in.', rw_you_need='["A startup name, live URL and a business email you read","A one-sentence pitch and a description of at least three or four sentences","A screenshot under 15MB"]', rw_eligibility='You need a live startup and a real inbox. Nothing is stated as a content bar.', rw_submit_steps='["1 Basic info: a name, website URL and business email. No account is created; they email a private edit link instead.","2 Your story: a one-sentence pitch, a description of at least three or four sentences and a required screenshot in PNG, JPG, WebP, GIF or HEIC up to 15MB.","3 Discovery details: optional country, city, category, tags, a video and social links, used to place the profile on market and location pages.","4 Land on the upsell. Submitting redirects to a promotion page confirming the submission is in and still in review."]', rw_submit_requirements='["A startup name, live URL and a business email","A one-sentence pitch and a multi-sentence description","A screenshot up to 15MB and optional discovery details"]', rw_rejection_reasons='["Nothing stated"]', rw_gotchas='["The required screenshot accepts PNG, JPG, WebP, GIF or HEIC up to 15MB — the only file and only hard limit.","There is no account, so the emailed private edit link is the only way back; mistype the address and you cannot edit later.","Submitting drops you straight on a paid promotion page — it reads as checkout until you notice the line saying the submission is already in.","The site answers 403 to non-browsers, so a script checking whether it is alive will conclude it is down when it is not."]', rw_faq='[{"question":"How long does Startup Buffer approval take?","answer":"No review time is published."},{"question":"How much does it cost to submit to Startup Buffer?","answer":"Submission is free; tracked promotion packages for homepage, newsletter and social distribution are sold separately after publication."},{"question":"Does a Startup Buffer listing provide a dofollow link?","answer":"Yes, a dofollow link on a domain rated 41."},{"question":"Do I need to link back to Startup Buffer?","answer":"No backlink is required."},{"question":"What gets a listing rejected?","answer":"Nothing stated."}]', rw_summary='Startup Buffer is a free dofollow startup directory with no account or badge and no backlink, using an emailed edit link. Domain rating is 41.', rw_fact_points='["No published review time","Free listing with a dofollow link","No badge or return link is expected","Accepts SaaS, indie products and marketplaces"]', rw_submission_checks='["Keep the edit email — there is no account.","The site blocks non-browser checks with 403.","Promotion is optional and sold after submit."]', rw_seo_title='Startup Buffer: Free Dofollow Listing, DR 41', rw_seo_description='How to submit to Startup Buffer: free dofollow listing, no badge or backlink. Emailed edit link from the 2026-11-16 snapshot.' WHERE slug='startup-buffer';
UPDATE submission_sites SET rw_source_lead='A scored comparison site that sells placement and publishes what it will not sell.', rw_what_you_get='A dofollow listing reached only by conversation, with a published promise that payment never buys a score or rank.', rw_you_need='["A product fitting one of 32 categories and 74 jobs","A conversation — there is no self-serve form"]', rw_eligibility='You need a fitting product and to talk to them. Anyone wanting a listing today is out — nothing here is self-serve.', rw_submit_steps='["1 Read what is for sale. The advertise page names three ways to work with them and draws the line at scores, rankings and verdicts.","2 Get in touch. There is no submission form; the path is a conversation and the price comes out of it."]', rw_submit_requirements='["A conversation — there is no self-serve submission","A price agreed rather than listed"]', rw_rejection_reasons='["Anyone wanting a listing today — nothing is self-serve"]', rw_gotchas='["No submission form exists anywhere — the submit path redirects to the advertise page and the only way in is email.","They score every tool with their own methodology and say payment cannot move it, so a paid placement can sit next to a middling score.","The pricing path redirects to the homepage, making the site look like it has a pricing page when it does not."]', rw_faq='[{"question":"How long does ToolChase approval take?","answer":"No review time is published."},{"question":"How much does it cost to submit to ToolChase?","answer":"Priced by conversation with no figures published; they state payment never buys a score, rank or favourable verdict."},{"question":"Does a ToolChase listing provide a dofollow link?","answer":"Yes, a dofollow link on a domain rated 41."},{"question":"Do I need to link back to ToolChase?","answer":"No backlink is required."},{"question":"What gets a listing rejected?","answer":"Anyone wanting a listing today — nothing is self-serve."}]', rw_summary='ToolChase is a paid, conversation-only dofollow comparison site with no backlink and no self-serve form. Domain rating is 41.', rw_fact_points='["No published review time","Paid by conversation, dofollow","No badge or return link is expected","Accepts SaaS and AI tools"]', rw_submission_checks='["There is no self-serve form.","Payment cannot buy a score or rank.","The pricing page redirects to the homepage."]', rw_seo_title='ToolChase: Conversation Listing, DR 41', rw_seo_description='How to get on ToolChase: conversation-only dofollow listing, no backlink. Payment cannot buy a score — 2026-11-16 snapshot.' WHERE slug='toolchase';
